                ASP.NET Core MVC framework pipeline v10.0 Target Runtime
            </div>
            <div class="border border-white/10 p-4 rounded-lg bg-black/20">
                <span class="text-cyan-400 font-semibold block mb-1">Frontend UI Assets</span>
                Tailwind CSS Playback Configuration engine using Glassmorphism configurations
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
